Output docs/demo.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1120
Set Height 520
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 25ms
Set PlaybackSpeed 1
Set Framerate 15
Hide
Type "export PS1='$ '; clear"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Show
Type "viewshape examples/snapshots/before.sqlite examples/snapshots/after.sqlite"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 12s
